    {
      "id": "21880084",
      "title": "What To Deploy?",
      "lectureOrder": 279,
      "videoOrder": 249,
      "sourceHash": "6e921c3132a6cbf4468e116fbf7b7dc3923e33f043a8535392ebadff5b5e7e74",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.45,
          "end": 4.34,
          "en": "Now, what does deploying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.34,
          "end": 7.17,
          "en": "a view app actually mean?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.17,
          "end": 9.19,
          "en": "For this, it's important to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.19,
          "end": 11.57,
          "en": "that Vue apps run in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.57,
          "end": 15.13,
          "en": "I mean, any website is loaded with a browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.13,
          "end": 19.453,
          "en": "but Vue apps are driven by browser-side JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 22.66,
          "en": "All the code we're writing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.66,
          "end": 26.12,
          "en": "in the end, is transformed by this project setup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.12,
          "end": 29.24,
          "en": "and then converted into JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.08,
          "end": 32.26,
          "en": "which our browser understands.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.26,
          "end": 34.31,
          "en": "So what we see on the screen here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.31,
          "end": 36.53,
          "en": "was loaded from a server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.53,
          "end": 40.28,
          "en": "but it was rendered on the screen by Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.28,
          "end": 42.57,
          "en": "by this JavaScript code we wrote",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.57,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "and that happened entirely in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 48.82,
          "en": "not on some server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.82,
          "end": 52.65,
          "en": "A server was just serving this HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.65,
          "end": 54.38,
          "en": "this HTML skeleton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.38,
          "end": 57.41,
          "en": "and then the JavaScript code, which again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.41,
          "end": 59.43,
          "en": "lost and executed in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.43,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "not on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 64.19,
          "en": "And I'm emphasizing this because this influences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.19,
          "end": 67.93,
          "en": "how we deploy a web application, a website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.93,
          "end": 70.87,
          "en": "Here, we really just have a couple of files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.87,
          "end": 73.81,
          "en": "which are all interpreted by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.81,
          "end": 78.65,
          "en": "We got our HTML files, in this case just one HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.65,
          "end": 81.47,
          "en": "since we're building a single page application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.47,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "We got CSS files possibly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 86.35,
          "en": "here in the projects we worked on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.35,
          "end": 89.28,
          "en": "we didn't have separate CSS files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.28,
          "end": 92.69,
          "en": "We merged that with the components and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.69,
          "end": 96.32,
          "en": "the project setup will take care about extracting this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.32,
          "end": 97.72,
          "en": "and adding it to the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.72,
          "end": 100.74000000000001,
          "en": "We have no separate CSS files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.74000000000001,
          "end": 102.62,
          "en": "And most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.62,
          "end": 105.08,
          "en": "we have a bunch of JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.08,
          "end": 107.97,
          "en": "Here for example, we have our project setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.97,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "and that project setup will have certain scripts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "for transforming the code we wrote,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 116.82,
          "en": "to code the browser understands.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.82,
          "end": 120.65,
          "en": "And I'll show you these scripts throughout this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.65,
          "end": 124.39,
          "en": "But therefore, we just have HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.39,
          "end": 128.46,
          "en": "We have no code that would run on a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.46,
          "end": 132.69,
          "en": "And therefore, we have a static web app, a static website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.69,
          "end": 135.07,
          "en": "Which means, it's just a website with code that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.07,
          "end": 136.89,
          "en": "is evaluated by the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.89,
          "end": 139.06,
          "en": "and has no server-side code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.06,
          "end": 144.06,
          "en": "And hence, a static website hosting provider is all we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.14,
          "end": 148.32999999999998,
          "en": "And options here would be AWS Free,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.32999999999998,
          "end": 151.22,
          "en": "Firebase Hosting, Netlify.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.22,
          "end": 154.13,
          "en": "There are tons of static hosting providers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.13,
          "end": 156.94,
          "en": "You can just Google for a static hosting provider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.94,
          "end": 158.993,
          "en": "and you'll find a couple of examples.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.12,
          "end": 161.14,
          "en": "So that's what we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.14,
          "end": 163.41,
          "en": "And I will show you an example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.31,
          "en": "and the full deployment process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.31,
          "end": 167.863,
          "en": "step-by-step throughout this module.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
